{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3018","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3018","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3018\",\"parent_revision\":\"e48eb4754199e62d17a59c8cb4bdf1413daddc9ababb71949becd9f23b390003\",\"root_revision\":\"e48eb4754199e62d17a59c8cb4bdf1413daddc9ababb71949becd9f23b390003\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nFound while validating PR #3015 (development-harness section-registry follow-up fixes). `tests/test_network_guard.py::test_guard_restores_sockets_after_session` and `test_no_public_allow_network_fixture` fail with `subprocess.TimeoutExpired` when run as part of the full suite under `pytest-xdist` parallel load, but pass cleanly in isolation (51s / 9 tests). This looks like resource contention (subprocess timeout too tight for a loaded parallel run), not a logic regression \u2014 confirmed unrelated to PR #3015's actual changes.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Root cause identified (timeout value too aggressive for xdist-parallel load vs. a real resource leak/race)\\n- [ ] Either the timeout is widened appropriately for parallel runs, or the test is isolated from xdist parallel workers (e.g. `xdist_group`), or the underlying contention is fixed\\n- [ ] Full suite run under normal xdist parallelism (`-n auto --dist loadgroup`) passes reliably across repeated runs\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer running the full test suite**, I want to **test_network_guard.py to pass reliably under xdist parallel execution**, so that **a flaky failure doesn't get mistaken for a real regression**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Observed directly during PR #3015 validation, 2026-08-19. Not a regression from that PR's changes \u2014 pre-existing flakiness surfaced by running the full suite.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"668fdb6a452798732c8fff46559b7b1d3c5b52b82d60643036c6cb4ebe9abbb1\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPiIdDA\"}"}